{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"357fb37abe8316d8541b972a0babd4e1bba26beb24f5060143bf03989d8b781d","digest":{"component_or_area":"capabilities.py - verdict tier derivation","key_entities":["capabilities.py:307-311","capabilities.py:384","capabilities.py:434","capabilities.py:439","config.py:214-241","KNOWN_PROVIDER_NAMES","_GATEWAY_PROVIDER_NAMES","gateway/anthropic","gateway/bedrock","gateway/google-cloud","gateway/groq","gateway/openai","base_url","endpoint_host","ProviderSession.provider_factory","test_verdict_provenance.py:264","test_capabilities_module_still_has_no_provider_name_prefix_matching"],"problem_keywords":["gateway provider","tier misrepresentation","provenance signing","verdict stamping","first_class tier"],"propositions":["A gateway/* provider without base_url incorrectly stamps tier as first_class instead of best_effort, misrepresenting provenance in signed verdicts.","The tier derivation logic at capabilities.py:307-311 checks only base_url but ignores that gateway/* providers route through intermediaries that can rewrite requests.","Gateway providers must be added to the tier determination logic alongside base_url so they are marked best_effort to reflect untrusted provenance.","Direct providers with no base_url must continue to stamp first_class; the fix uses registry membership rather than string prefix matching to avoid false positives.","endpoint_host should remain None for gateway providers unless explicitly configured with base_url, preserving the distinction between configured and synthesized values."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787731370503000001,"uuid":"db416b46-bbc0-4abe-83d9-f8c8879be4b0"}